From 2fc9bb57b1bcc61703afe23363dbfbd20c17fc93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] VibeSkua: make child HWND repositioning synchronous

Rapid tray hide/show can trigger repeated host visibility and activation events
while child game HWNDs are being repositioned. Avoid queuing this SetWindowPos
operation asynchronously; perform it synchronously on the host UI thread so
the native reposition request does not remain pending across a visibility
transition.

This is a targeted mitigation for the suspected race, not a confirmed root
cause. Test rapid hide/show with one and multiple tabs before treating it as
fixed.

---
 Skua.App.Avalonia/Views/TabbedHostWindow.axaml.cs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Skua.App.Avalonia/Views/TabbedHostWindow.axaml.cs b/Skua.App.Avalonia/Views/TabbedHostWindow.axaml.cs
--- a/Skua.App.Avalonia/Views/TabbedHostWindow.axaml.cs
+++ b/Skua.App.Avalonia/Views/TabbedHostWindow.axaml.cs
@@ -1,1 +1,1 @@
-                        SWP_SHOWWINDOW | SWP_NOACTIVATE | SWP_ASYNCWINDOWPOS | SWP_NOZORDER);
+                        SWP_SHOWWINDOW | SWP_NOACTIVATE | SWP_NOZORDER);
--
2.0.0
